{"4507460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Static Line", "steam_appid": 4507460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PILOT THE VF-01 VESSEL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/extras/d91c8d216f1fb9efd5010c5aeff2bf8b.poster.avif?t=1788163965\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/extras/d91c8d216f1fb9efd5010c5aeff2bf8b.webm?t=1788163965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/extras/d91c8d216f1fb9efd5010c5aeff2bf8b.mp4?t=1788163965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take direct control of the <strong>VF-01 Vessel</strong>, an airborne combat frame built for speed, precision, and overwhelming firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost, climb, and dive through combat zones. Aim independently from your movement and strike with twin arm-mounted weapons. Intercept incoming missiles as Aerion machines swarm in from all sides, lock onto multiple targets, and unleash full salvos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut through the chaos as allied and enemy forces collide across the sky, breaking through waves of machines in battles filled with speed, firepower, and cascading destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACE COLOSSAL AERION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/extras/2b00d676ad1de25babeb99f84da3b738.poster.avif?t=1788163965\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/extras/2b00d676ad1de25babeb99f84da3b738.webm?t=1788163965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/extras/2b00d676ad1de25babeb99f84da3b738.mp4?t=1788163965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge enormous machine bosses built around spectacle, pressure, and decisive destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive screen-filling attacks, find your opening, and drive the Vessel through escalating encounters until the impossible machine comes crashing down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR VESSEL. ASSEMBLE YOUR FORCE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/extras/34dc1da24abe7440e6a67ea9d2a2a7e6.poster.avif?t=1788163965\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/extras/34dc1da24abe7440e6a67ea9d2a2a7e6.webm?t=1788163965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/extras/34dc1da24abe7440e6a67ea9d2a2a7e6.mp4?t=1788163965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between sorties, change weapons, shape your allied unit deck, unlock avionics, and prepare the next configuration at the supply depot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build around interception, sustained fire, concentrated strikes, or the support units you want beside you. Then launch again with a setup that fights differently from the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/extras/5ea8ace8934eddbbfe6ec46c9386b66c.poster.avif?t=1788163965\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/extras/5ea8ace8934eddbbfe6ec46c9386b66c.webm?t=1788163965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/extras/5ea8ace8934eddbbfe6ec46c9386b66c.mp4?t=1788163965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FOLLOW THE SIGNAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/extras/f527188763c6036737ddf5be4c06b964.poster.avif?t=1788163965\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/extras/f527188763c6036737ddf5be4c06b964.webm?t=1788163965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/extras/f527188763c6036737ddf5be4c06b964.mp4?t=1788163965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the next Contact along a branching Line, enter unexpected event nodes, and return to the console between battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some signals offer guidance. Some interfere. Some seem to remember decisions that should have been forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow them deeper.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PILOT THE VF-01 VESSEL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/extras/d91c8d216f1fb9efd5010c5aeff2bf8b.poster.avif?t=1788163965\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/extras/d91c8d216f1fb9efd5010c5aeff2bf8b.webm?t=1788163965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/extras/d91c8d216f1fb9efd5010c5aeff2bf8b.mp4?t=1788163965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take direct control of the <strong>VF-01 Vessel</strong>, an airborne combat frame built for speed, precision, and overwhelming firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost, climb, and dive through combat zones. Aim independently from your movement and strike with twin arm-mounted weapons. Intercept incoming missiles as Aerion machines swarm in from all sides, lock onto multiple targets, and unleash full salvos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut through the chaos as allied and enemy forces collide across the sky, breaking through waves of machines in battles filled with speed, firepower, and cascading destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACE COLOSSAL AERION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/extras/2b00d676ad1de25babeb99f84da3b738.poster.avif?t=1788163965\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/extras/2b00d676ad1de25babeb99f84da3b738.webm?t=1788163965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/extras/2b00d676ad1de25babeb99f84da3b738.mp4?t=1788163965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge enormous machine bosses built around spectacle, pressure, and decisive destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive screen-filling attacks, find your opening, and drive the Vessel through escalating encounters until the impossible machine comes crashing down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR VESSEL. ASSEMBLE YOUR FORCE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/extras/34dc1da24abe7440e6a67ea9d2a2a7e6.poster.avif?t=1788163965\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/extras/34dc1da24abe7440e6a67ea9d2a2a7e6.webm?t=1788163965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/extras/34dc1da24abe7440e6a67ea9d2a2a7e6.mp4?t=1788163965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between sorties, change weapons, shape your allied unit deck, unlock avionics, and prepare the next configuration at the supply depot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build around interception, sustained fire, concentrated strikes, or the support units you want beside you. Then launch again with a setup that fights differently from the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/extras/5ea8ace8934eddbbfe6ec46c9386b66c.poster.avif?t=1788163965\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/extras/5ea8ace8934eddbbfe6ec46c9386b66c.webm?t=1788163965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/extras/5ea8ace8934eddbbfe6ec46c9386b66c.mp4?t=1788163965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FOLLOW THE SIGNAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/extras/f527188763c6036737ddf5be4c06b964.poster.avif?t=1788163965\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/extras/f527188763c6036737ddf5be4c06b964.webm?t=1788163965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/extras/f527188763c6036737ddf5be4c06b964.mp4?t=1788163965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the next Contact along a branching Line, enter unexpected event nodes, and return to the console between battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some signals offer guidance. Some interfere. Some seem to remember decisions that should have been forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow them deeper.</p>", "short_description": "Pilot the VF-01 Vessel in a side-view mecha action roguelite. Customize your weapons, assemble a task force, strike mission targets, and push the frontline across branching battlefields.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Polish, Russian, Vietnamese, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/6773cbc8a87119ba2dc91fe0470ccc426b5da0be/header.jpg?t=1788163965", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/451e1499ea6a60bdb054a0ce1892933bb1a6d68d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788163965", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507460/451e1499ea6a60bdb054a0ce1892933bb1a6d68d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788163965", "website": "http://deepsignalgames.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel® Core™ i3-4160 (dual-core) / AMD® 